-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/HTKN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Obsolete name. Trace contaminated gabbroic-rock, gabbro, gabbroic-rock, gabbronorite, migmatitic gabbro, norite, olivine-gabbro, orthopyroxenite, pegmatitic gabbro, peridotite, serpentinite, troctolite, ultramafic-rock and xenolithic gabbro. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Ordovician Period (486.9-443.1 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/KNOC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gabbro and peridotite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Ordovician Period (486.9-443.1 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LBN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Limestone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Gorstian Age (Silurian Period) (426.7-425 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LEL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Gorstian Age (Silurian Period) (426.7-425 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LLT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Ludfordian Age (Silurian Period) (425-422.7 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/MELB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Gorstian Age (Silurian Period) (426.7-425 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/MSHET> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dolerite, felsite, granite, lamprophyre, mafite, microdiorite and microtonalite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Mid Devonian Epoch - to - Late Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (394.3-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/MVCA> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gabbro. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Ordovician Period (486.9-443.1 Ma BP)."@en .
