-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/OBFE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Agglomerate, analcime-gabbro, basalt, felsite, olivine-microgabbro and syenitic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Devonian Period (419-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/ODMIV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Obsolete name. Trace agglomerate, analcime-gabbro, basalt, felsite, olivine-microgabbro and syenitic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Devonian Period (419-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/OLNA> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Diorite, granodiorite and ultramafic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Early Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (419-394.3 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/UBB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Gorstian Age (Silurian Period) (426.7-425 Ma BP)."@en .
